sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant U as Frontend Client
    participant GW as Nginx Gateway
    participant MW as Middleware Pipeline
    participant R as Inventory Router
    participant IS as Inventory Service
    participant CE as Classification Engine
    participant AW as Approval Workflow
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant RD as Redis Cache
    participant AL as Audit Logger

    Note over U,AL: AI System Registration + Dual Classification Flow

    U->>GW: POST /api/v1/systems (CreateSystemPayload)
    GW->>GW: Rate limit check · TLS · Request ID
    GW->>MW: Forward request
    MW->>MW: JWT verify → RBAC check → Request log
    MW->>R: Authenticated request + user context

    R->>IS: register_system(payload, user_id)
    
    rect rgb(220, 240, 255)
        Note over IS,CE: Step 1 — Dual Classification
        IS->>CE: classify(system_metadata)
        CE->>CE: _classify_eu(): Prohibited → High (Annex III) → Limited → Minimal
        CE->>CE: _classify_us(): OMB M-25-21 category matching
        CE->>CE: _compute_risk_score(): EU(40%) + US(25%) + Data(20%) + Auto(15%)
        CE->>CE: _assess_confidence(): HIGH / MEDIUM / LOW
        CE-->>IS: ClassificationResult(eu_tier, us_designation, score, confidence)
    end

    rect rgb(220, 255, 220)
        Note over IS,DB: Step 2 — Persist with Versioning
        IS->>DB: INSERT ai_systems (with classification fields)
        IS->>DB: INSERT risk_classifications (rationale JSON)
        IS->>DB: INSERT ai_system_versions (immutable v1 snapshot)
    end

    rect rgb(255, 235, 220)
        Note over IS,AW: Step 3 — Conditional Approval Trigger
        alt EU tier = HIGH or PROHIBITED
            IS->>AW: create_workflow(system_id, trigger=REGISTRATION)
            AW->>DB: INSERT approval_workflows (48h SLA)
            AW->>RD: Cache pending approval count
            AW-->>IS: workflow_id
        end
    end

    IS->>AL: emit_event(SYSTEM_REGISTERED, system_id, classification)
    AL->>DB: INSERT audit_events (immutable)

    IS-->>R: AISystemResponse (with classification + workflow)
    R-->>MW: 201 Created + JSON body
    MW->>MW: Response log · Metrics emit · Trace complete
    MW-->>GW: Response
    GW-->>U: 201 Created + AISystemResponse
